{"id": "Dev5C7MyV-5", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Who captured Indra, the king of the gods? 🔱\n\nRavana finds his son Meghnad at a fire altar, in deerskin and matted hair. Guru Shukracharya tells him: this boy has finished seven great yajnas, and in the Maheshwar yajna he got boons from Pashupati himself. A chariot that goes anywhere in the sky, the tamasi maya, quivers that never empty, a bow no one can beat.\n\nRavana marches on Swarg. Indra runs to Vishnu, and Vishnu says: not now. But one day I will kill this Ravana, with his sons.\n\nThen, in the dark, Indra seizes Ravana himself.\n\nKatha 2, Part 1 of 2. Part 2: who saved Ravana.\n\nSources: Valmiki Ramayana, Uttara Kanda 7.25, 7.27-29\n\n#ravana #indrajit #meghnad #mahadev #ramayana", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792568619, "like_count": 1275, "comment_count": 4, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-4760861747572610a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 57.845, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP7_Waw9NVSCVQwSswVEyDenm6A-kFpBIJDRzKwOJ9MKEfiYDDcVFDmWs4x00PrMJzK196FR1d-EbzK93DC4_efA1OnZmjdk4g2h-o.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdoyBY9z4K9e5JEHA7QkuBW9UQXVN66kNfQPd-aeA0gYrooXAG-tX-rWMB_b4RBIR-xoHJvwwigYXhWMibnwAjac&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=PpKinBV74wQQ7kNvwHoJ5hW&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=CQeAuw6n5VA_ZOdEXFiDxA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQS4dguyllJRrzj4r2tXFdCF3C51cKcanFGR7PHImjF-rQ&oe=6AF43E66", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 57.845, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/1